%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Dashboard UI
    participant API as Youth Account Management API
    participant AccountService as Account Service
    participant TransactionService as Transaction Service
    participant PaymentService as Payment Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB
    
    %% Dashboard View
    Parent->>UI: Login & select youth account
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/dashboard
    API->>DB: Fetch youth account, settings
    API->>AccountService: Fetch account details
    API->>TransactionService: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>UI: Dashboard data (account, limit, recent txns)
    UI-->>Parent: Show dashboard
    
    %% Fund Transfer
    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/fund-transfer
    API->>PaymentService: Initiate transfer
    PaymentService-->>API: Transfer status
    API->>DB: Update account balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer result
    UI-->>Parent: Show confirmation
    
    %% Spending Limit Configuration
    Parent->>UI: Set/Update spending limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update spending limit
    API-->>UI: Limit updated
    UI-->>Parent: Show update
    
    %% Transaction History
    Parent->>UI: View transaction history
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/transactions
    API->>TransactionService: Fetch transactions
    API-->>UI: Paginated transaction list
    UI-->>Parent: Show history